/* brief7 · v3 analyst brief for 7.3 Risks */
(function(){
'use strict';
const V=window.V3;if(!V)return;const {L,P,lede,sh,imp,calc,fig,kpis}=V;
window.V3MODS=window.V3MODS||{};
window.V3MODS['s7-3']=()=>{const I=window.MODEL.cur.inputs,g=I.seed.phase0_gap,gap=g.research_setup_costs-g.phase0_budget;
 return [[['In short · where the real risk sits','Uchambuzi · hatari halisi iko wapi'],`<div class="v3b">
  ${lede('The register scores 22 risks for likelihood and impact on a scale of one to five, and multiplies the two. Most land in the middle of the range, where a named owner, an early warning sign and a planned response are enough. Only two score fifteen or more, and both are settled before the store opens.','Rejista inapima hatari 22 kwa uwezekano na athari kwa kipimo cha moja hadi tano, na kuzidisha hivyo viwili. Nyingi zinaangukia katikati, ambapo mmiliki aliyetajwa, ishara ya mapema na jibu lililopangwa vinatosha. Mbili tu zina alama ya kumi na tano au zaidi, na zote zinashughulikiwa kabla duka halijafunguliwa.')}
  </div>
  ${fig({title:['Two risks need action now; most need monitoring','Hatari mbili zinahitaji hatua sasa; nyingi zinahitaji ufuatiliaji'],sub:['The 22 risks in the register, by score (likelihood × impact, maximum 25)','Hatari 22 katika rejista, kwa alama (uwezekano × athari, juu kabisa 25)'],src:['Source: risk register, section 7.3','Chanzo: rejista ya hatari, sehemu 7.3'],note:['Scores are the founders’ assessment, reviewed monthly','Alama ni tathmini ya waanzilishi, inapitiwa kila mwezi'],
   chart:{type:'cols',max:10,ticks:[0,2,4,6,8,10],twoLine:1,hl:0,bars:[[['15–16|act now','15–16|hatua sasa'],2,'2'],[['12|high','12|juu'],8,'8','#b08a3c'],[['10|serious if it happens','10|kubwa ikitokea'],4,'4','grn'],[['9|manage','9|simamia'],4,'4','grn2'],[['6–8|monitor','6–8|fuatilia'],4,'4','#5b6b64']]}})}
  <div class="v3b">
  ${sh('The two risks that score highest','Hatari mbili zenye alama za juu zaidi')}
  ${P(`<strong>The Phase 0 gap (score 16).</strong> Research, travel and setup before launch are estimated at about TSh ${Math.round(g.research_setup_costs/1e6)}M against a Phase 0 budget of TSh ${(g.phase0_budget/1e6).toFixed(2)}M, a gap of about TSh ${Math.round(gap/1e6)}M that neither seed option covers. The answer is to settle it before the term sheet: add it to the round, have the founders pre-fund it, or run a leaner Phase 0.`,`<strong>Pengo la Awamu 0 (alama 16).</strong> Utafiti, safari na maandalizi kabla ya uzinduzi vinakadiriwa kuwa takriban TSh milioni ${Math.round(g.research_setup_costs/1e6)} dhidi ya bajeti ya Awamu 0 ya TSh milioni ${(g.phase0_budget/1e6).toFixed(2)}, pengo la takriban TSh milioni ${Math.round(gap/1e6)} ambalo halijagharamiwa na chaguo lolote la mtaji wa awali. Jibu ni kulitatua kabla ya hati ya masharti: kuliongeza kwenye awamu, waanzilishi kulilipia mapema, au kuendesha Awamu 0 nyepesi zaidi.`)}
  ${P('<strong>A sector permit is delayed (score 15).</strong> TMDA, the Pharmacy Council or TBS could take longer than planned. Scoping starts five months before opening with a consultant, and the tranche that pays for stock is released only when the permits are in hand, so a delay costs time, not stock that cannot be sold.','<strong>Kibali cha sekta kinachelewa (alama 15).</strong> TMDA, Baraza la Famasi au TBS vinaweza kuchukua muda mrefu kuliko ilivyopangwa. Maandalizi yanaanza miezi mitano kabla ya kufungua pamoja na mshauri, na awamu inayolipia bidhaa inatolewa tu vibali vikiwa mkononi, hivyo kuchelewa kunagharimu muda, si bidhaa zisizoweza kuuzwa.')}
  ${calc({t:['Worked example · reading a score','Mfano wa hesabu · kusoma alama'],
   rows:[['A shipment is late or held at clearance: likelihood','Mzigo unachelewa au unazuiliwa bandarini: uwezekano','4 of 5'],['× impact','× athari','3 of 5'],['Score','Alama','12 · high',1]],
   n:['Likely but containable: six weeks of safety stock on the top 100 items and a second supplier for each mean a late container slows the range rather than emptying the shelf.','Inawezekana lakini inadhibitika: wiki sita za akiba kwa bidhaa 100 za juu na msambazaji wa pili kwa kila moja vinamaanisha kontena linalochelewa linapunguza bidhaa badala ya kuacha rafu tupu.']})}
  ${imp('No single risk in the register threatens the business on its own once the two highest are settled before opening. The design choices made elsewhere, gated growth, tranches tied to milestones, registered products only and a working-capital reserve, are themselves the main risk controls, which is why the register is short on surprises.','Hakuna hatari moja katika rejista inayotishia biashara peke yake pindi mbili za juu zaidi zinapotatuliwa kabla ya kufungua. Maamuzi ya muundo yaliyofanywa sehemu nyingine, ukuaji wenye vizingiti, awamu zinazofungwa na hatua, bidhaa zilizosajiliwa pekee na akiba ya mtaji wa kazi, yenyewe ndiyo udhibiti mkuu wa hatari, ndiyo maana rejista ina mambo machache ya kushangaza.')}
  </div>`]];};
})();

